# Agent plans (standing rule)

Plans and rules are in the repo so an agent on another device has the same context. Do not rely on the local Cursor profile (`~/.cursor/plans`).

- Rules: `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (always applied)
- Plans: `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`

When the task matches a plan below, read that file before editing. A plan records intent and constraints; it is not a new order to re-implement work that is already in the tree. If code and a plan disagree, follow the code and the other standing rules, and update the plan only when the user asks to change the plan.

